{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## Examples\n\nEXAMPLE INPUT:\n    John is 50 and works as a teacher.\n    \n    EXAMPLE OUTPUT:\n    ```json\n    {\"name\":\"John\",\"age\":50}\n    ```\n\nexample input:\nWe have recently hired Ian, who is 27 years old.\noutput:\n```json\n{\"name\":\"Ian\",\"age\":27}\n```\n\n## Output Requirements\n\nRespond with a strict JSON object that matches this JSON Schema:\n\n{\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"x-title\": \"User\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"age\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\"\n        },\n        \"name\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n        \"age\",\n        \"name\"\n    ],\n    \"x-php-class\": \"User\",\n    \"additionalProperties\": false\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"Our user Jason is 25 years old."}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"response_format":{"type":"json_object"}}